>Subsequent updates—Chapters 3, 4, and 5 (Full Release)—are planned to<br>roll out sequentially starting from Q2 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/39dd16c48f36ff52e2c3b6f0c1f28ebe.avif?t=1787294172\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.poster.avif?t=1787294172\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.webm?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/5bcbd0773fc7886023bc7b11753e3d2d.mp4?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features two places:<br>A real world where people live ordinary lives and a ‘Boundary’ created by evil spirits with grudges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although two worlds are clearly similar, there are differences between them.<br>Also, they are separate but closely connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcise evil spirits hiding in the boundary and threatening<br>the safety of people in order to protect their precious daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/9073c76dd7d0cdc8dbf5ade8950341b0.avif?t=1787294172\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.poster.avif?t=1787294172\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.webm?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/2f9cca55ea1da187cc5672698edbdc15.mp4?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.poster.avif?t=1787294172\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.webm?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/57568483e228fa4a5b232e1b874fef68.mp4?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of distinctive puzzles inspired by everyday life,<br>Korean culture, and traditional folktales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some may appear complex at first glance,<br>they are designed with simple and intuitive mechanics—such as spot-the-difference or riddles—allowing global players with no prior knowledge to enjoy them effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/854b1b9c5abb18005992b13c898b1e2b.avif?t=1787294172\" width=1240 height=128 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.poster.avif?t=1787294172\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.webm?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/070ef9f182f84507786693ca5e0dd763.mp4?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, players will encounter enemies and spirits that threaten the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From minor ghosts patrolling the map to vengeful spirits serving as chapter bosses,<br>players must explore various areas while evading them, experiencing the tension and thrill unique to horror games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/d96738f9dba4f5984471e6c55355e10c.avif?t=1787294172\" width=1240 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.poster.avif?t=1787294172\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.webm?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/64c41ce818a68010071e79cad4785897.mp4?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incense serves as a medium that attracts wandering ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By extinguishing incense placed throughout the map,<br>players can dispel these minor spirits and safely continue their investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.poster.avif?t=1787294172\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.webm?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/cf1b0ba3f884d94d612439eca662e998.mp4?t=1787294172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, relics imbued with the grudges and lingering regrets<br>of powerful vengeful spirits are hidden across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cursed items contain the remnants of their malice, sorrow, and obsession from their mortal lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Boundary, understand the grudges and desires of demons,<br>and help them ascend to heaven by purifying their souls.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras/fa4f4cda16ed91de3ef5c10848be6a30.avif?t=1787294172\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/extras_big/fa4f4cda16ed91de3ef5c10848be6a30.avif?t=1787294172 width=800 height=216 /></span></p>", "short_description": "One day, A girl accidentally gets involved with the 'KEA (Korean Exorcist Association)' and the evil organization 'Lunacide'... Will be able to stop Lunacide's plot and be reborn as a proper exorcist?", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/2ee202f6b98b2a1a8fc834baafac88acb32f0360/header.jpg?t=1787294172", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/b99d3a841ca4eaf63b795f2468166891dc288d1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787294172", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816720/b99d3a841ca4eaf63b795f2468166891dc288d1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787294172", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft Windows 8.1 (32bit/64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel N4100 (or similar) or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft Windows 10 (32bit/64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel N4100 (or similar) or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 460 / Radeon HD 7800 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["TEAMDADA"], "publishers": ["TEAMDADA"], "demos": [{"appid": 3839370, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1899, "final": 1899, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$18.99"}, "packages": [1342500], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Ghost Deliverer", "description"